{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act44side_level_act44side_01_end",
  "groupId": "act44side",
  "stageId": "act44side_01",
  "title": "极道作风",
  "storyCode": "AT-1",
  "avgTag": "行动后",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act44side/level_act44side_01_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "e69d82f0105094c8c421422ad7bf87266293ac301841d65c291a9a18c6f5755a",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "64_g1_jindastreet_d"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1918_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（打哈欠）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1918_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "新口味煎饼，“高级网纹蜜瓜配叙拉古风情红酱”，还有“甄选浓厚瘤奶配本酿造酱油”......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1918_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看起来好好吃啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1918_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不行，热量，时刻谨记热量！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1918_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？澪小姐？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1918_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯，我马上就到事务所了。有急事？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1918_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1918_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我马上过去——跑着过去！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "62_g13_directorstudio"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1918_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“把粉丝当傻瓜，鼻孔朝天”......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1918_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“再也不粉这个人了，演唱会搞得乱七八糟”......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1918_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“想炒热点想疯了，假装害怕不尬吗”......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1918_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这......这怎么回事？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澪",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "舆论攻击。时间上，昨天凌晨开始。应该是竞争对手所为。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澪",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所长。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1918_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所长，您亲自来了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "事务所所长",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1257_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "情况怎么样了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澪",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "事发突然，公关还在查。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "事务所所长",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1257_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不光是公关。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澪",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您的意思是？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "事务所所长",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1257_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那个“独角的鬼”，可不是我们的人安排上去的，对不对？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "事务所所长",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1257_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "澪，萌萌香的人身安全毕竟也是你负责，拜托你查清这件事了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澪",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "事务所所长",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1257_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "萌萌香，比起昨天舞台上的失态，“上面”更不满意的是另一件事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1918_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "另一件事......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "事务所所长",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1257_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你最近的言行越来越不像是偶像该有的样子，事后竟然直接消失不见——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1918_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "当时粉丝好像并没有特别负面的反应，返场的时候我也额外多唱了一首，大家的反应还挺好的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1918_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "散场之后，我又累又饿，而且又害怕，就去了一趟常去的那个关东煮摊子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "事务所所长",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1257_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那你对演唱会上的不当发言又作何解释？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1918_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不当发言？！我、我说错什么话了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澪",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "关于锻冶町的发言。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1918_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "锻冶町？哦，你是说那个粉丝——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "事务所所长",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1257_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们事务所的运营全靠金石集团的支持，现在锻冶町和集团关系紧张，你贸然表达自己的立场只会让我们所有人难办。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1918_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不了解其中的缘由......我原本只想着自己第一部电影是在那里拍的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1918_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我还记得我最开始来到这的时候，你说是铁斋社长看中了我的能力......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "事务所所长",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1257_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "以前是以前，现在是现在。情况已经不一样了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "事务所所长",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1257_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "再说，我们一直告诉你，不要说越界的话，老老实实按照写好的台本念。人们想看的是萌萌香，不是乱说话的你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1918_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我......我明白了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澪",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "事务所所长",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1257_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你明白就好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1918_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所长......我们什么时候去录音棚？今天的日程挺满的，我得再努力一点。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "事务所所长",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1257_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉，算了。你要不还是先休息几天吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1918_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "欸？欸？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1918_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所、所长，我没问题的！我已经调整好了！我知道最近工期很紧，现在休息的话，之后好几天的安排都会受影响！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "事务所所长",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1257_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "说不定你昨天白天少做点事，晚上还能镇定一点。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1918_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "抱歉！但是——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "事务所所长",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1257_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "萌萌香，你要是真愿意将功补过，这里有个现成的紧急工作交给你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1918_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我愿意的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "事务所所长",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1257_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这是电视台刚发来的节目邀请，你看看吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1918_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "锻冶町......鬼屋探访？！怎么又是这样的节目！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1918_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而且为什么偏偏要在这个时间节点，制作这种对锻冶町不利的节目......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "事务所所长",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1257_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那你是想休息？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1918_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不是！可......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "事务所所长",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1257_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "萌萌香，你应该明白，不听我们的，对你影响更大。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1918_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "事务所所长",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1257_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "萌萌香！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1918_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所长，我不想死啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1918_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我早就知道那是鬼屋，里面好像连着死过好几个人......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1918_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那个鬼屋据说还和“无名之鬼”有关系，昨天舞台上那个就是她......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "事务所所长",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1257_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澪",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "事务所所长",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1257_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃，萌萌香，我们会给你做好安保措施的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "事务所所长",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1257_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（小声）澪，你也表示一下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澪",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......萌萌香，我也会陪你去的，放心吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1918_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "澪、澪小姐也去吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澪",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1918_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你能打过那个恶鬼吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "澪歪着脑袋，很认真地想了几秒钟。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澪",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不一定。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1918_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1918_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "完蛋了完蛋了完蛋了完蛋了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "64_g5_kajistreet_d"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "64_g5_kajistreet_d"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "说不清带着木头味还是霉味的风扑到脸上，星熊不由自主地深吸了一口气。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_136_hsguma_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......房子都旧了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_136_hsguma_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "铁斋叔还住原来的地方吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1896_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没错，尽头的大宅子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_136_hsguma_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "金兵卫，所以葬礼到底是怎么回事？锻冶町不是还好好的吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1896_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这件事说来话长——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1896_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_136_hsguma_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎么了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "星熊很快意识到金兵卫闭口不言，甚至连脸上的神色都恭敬了几分的原因。\n不远处，一位老人正面朝他们站在那里。\n老人的背已经有些佝偻。风吹起他宽大的袍袖，不知怎的，却只显得他整个人站得更直了些。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_136_hsguma_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "铁斋叔！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1896_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "铁斋会长。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铁斋",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1895_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铁斋",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1895_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "金兵卫，我跟你说过，不许再踏进锻冶町一步。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "高大的斐迪亚怔了怔，脸上的恭敬转为惶恐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1896_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我本想着今天有大喜事，这才失了分寸，无意间进了锻冶町......当真该死。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铁斋",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1895_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她和你沆瀣一气，这就是你所谓的喜事？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1896_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "会长，我只是把她从警局带来而已。她刚一进御机就被警察逮了进去，刚刚才出来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1896_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她是因为关心情切才赶了回来。您有什么不满就冲我来，千万别怪罪她！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1896_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "至于我擅闯锻冶町一事，是土下座，是改日正式登门赔罪，还是断指——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铁斋",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1895_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈！我让你做，你就做吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1896_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "听凭您发落——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莽撞的黑道",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1906_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呼、呼......老大！我问了一圈才知道您原来到锻冶町来了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莽撞的黑道",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1906_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您亲自来这里做什么？老家伙没几天好蹦跶了，您何必亲自到这鬼地方来——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1896_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莽撞的黑道",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1906_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "老、老大？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1896_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你倒知道我是老大？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1896_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那你知不知道，是谁给了你口中的老大今天这样尊崇的地位？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莽撞的黑道",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1906_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1896_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哦，对，你也不是第一次了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1896_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "此前铁斋会长严令我和我的手下不得进入锻冶町，你可不止一次闯进这里来，对不对？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莽撞的黑道",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1906_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那不是——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1896_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "锻冶町三户住家都是被你赶走的，商铺也有两家被你搅黄搬走，而且都是在铁斋会长下令之后，对不对？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1896_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "明知故犯，该当何罪？"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "莽撞的黑道急得额头冒汗。\n老大平时可不是这样的，老大是那个自己做得好时和自己把酒言欢，做得差时温言鼓励的——\n脑子里的念头还没过完，他忽然听见一声响。\n唰。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铁斋",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1895_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "住手！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_136_hsguma_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "金兵卫，你做什么？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "念头在还未过完时就被斩断，黑道没了头颅的身躯扑通一声倒在地上。\n铁斋的铁扇子，星熊的般若，都没能赶上斐迪亚猛然间抽出的大太刀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铁斋",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1895_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他是你金石会的兄弟！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铁斋",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1895_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在我这个会长面前自相残杀，你是公然宣布要违逆我吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1896_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可会中的管教之权，您老也已经交到我手中了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1896_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不听劝阻，冲撞会长，屡教不改，他早该死了。容他活到现在，已经是我治理无方。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1896_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "现在人已经带到，我的事情也已完成。我违背铁斋会长命令的事，也该做个了断。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "他把手中沾满鲜血，尚未纳入刀鞘的大太刀对准自己的手指。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "在老人开口之前，斐迪亚又是一刀，自己左手的小指瞬间和手掌脱离，掉在地上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1896_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这样就算两清了吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "没人说话。\n斐迪亚纳刀入鞘，朝着铁斋恭恭敬敬地施了一礼，又对着星熊点了点头。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1896_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "铁斋会长，我就不多在您面前碍眼了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1896_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "星熊，归乡愉快。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_136_hsguma_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我去报警——"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "想起警局里金兵卫跋扈的样子，星熊的话没有说完。\n而老人微微眯起眼睛，看了星熊一眼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铁斋",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1895_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看来你在龙门过得不错。已经不混黑道了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铁斋",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1895_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要是还在道上，你就不会忘......道上的人无论怎么死，总是会有人“收拾”的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铁斋",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1895_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只要有人“收拾”，警察就不会愿意来管我们这里这些糟烂事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铁斋",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1895_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铁斋",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1895_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "旅途劳顿，进屋说话吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "64_g9_higashigarden_d"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "尽管已阔别二十年，星熊仍然轻车熟路地推门进院。\n和锻冶町一样，这里的时间几乎没有流动的痕迹。星熊一眼看见自己以前常走的那条小路，那是穿过庭院最快的方式。\n她甚至不知道是池里的锦鳞一直活到了现在，还是房屋的主人一直在往池里补充同样花色的鳞。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "64_g8_tessaihome"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_136_hsguma_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我回来了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铁斋",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1895_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......坐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_136_hsguma_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "铁斋叔，您给我写信，难道是因为金兵卫——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铁斋",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1895_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我没给你写信。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_136_hsguma_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不是您？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铁斋",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1895_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "二十年前你离开御机时我就跟你说过，告别之后，永不联络。我从来没想过打破这个诺言。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_136_hsguma_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那这封信......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铁斋",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1895_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "金兵卫仿的。还能是怎么回事？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_136_hsguma_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他为什么要这么做？您是金石会的会长，怎么能容忍他肆意妄为？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铁斋",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1895_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "会长？要不是刚刚那条毒蛇一口一个会长，我都已经忘了自己还是什么劳什子会长了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铁斋",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1895_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一句话，我现在不过是个被架空的老头，连最后的地盘，你面前这个锻冶町，也要被人夺走了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铁斋",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1895_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而金兵卫......哈，我一手创立的源石晶体企业已经彻底被他控制，金石会下面的这些产业现在都在他的手里。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铁斋",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1895_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "连电视台和演艺事务所这种生意，都被他做得风生水起。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_136_hsguma_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "按您这么说，他几乎已经占据了金石会下面全部的产业，还要夺走锻冶町？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铁斋",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1895_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“一场天翻地覆的开发计划”，一个月前他的原话。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铁斋",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1895_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "至于谁开发，怎么开发，开发收益归谁，哈，那当然不是我能过问的事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_136_hsguma_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以您才禁止他和他的人进入锻冶町。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铁斋",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1895_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "然后就有了今天，他拿手下兄弟性命做戏给我们看的这一幕......哦，与其说是做戏，倒不如说是立威更贴切一点。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_136_hsguma_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......他以前不是这样的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铁斋",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1895_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他当年演得太好了，骗过了我，骗过了你。还能有什么解释？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铁斋",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1895_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你以为断指就不是演戏了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_136_hsguma_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这......怎么演？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铁斋",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1895_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "演出道具、断指再植，甚至最近流行的仿生义肢......他的办法多的是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铁斋",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1895_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "刚刚那根本就不是什么“两清”，那只是侮辱......对我，对整个金石会，对整个极道的侮辱。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铁斋",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1895_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不知道金兵卫叫你回来打的是什么主意，但你现在唯一该做的，就是赶快回龙门，再也不要回来。他现在就是条发疯的牙兽。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_136_hsguma_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那您怎么办？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铁斋",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1895_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我？只要金石会还存在，我还是这个有名无实的会长，金兵卫就不敢光明正大地对我下手。这已经足够了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_136_hsguma_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不能走。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铁斋",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1895_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那你想做什么？等金兵卫真把我逼到不得不自尽的时候，帮我结束痛苦？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_136_hsguma_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我只是不想再后悔一次。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铁斋",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1895_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "去龙门这件事，你终究还是后悔了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_136_hsguma_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，我的后悔，桩桩件件都在御机。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_136_hsguma_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看着刚刚那个人被金兵卫随随便便砍下头颅的时候，后悔的滋味几乎要从我胃里反出来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铁斋",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1895_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "对金兵卫背后的人来说，锻冶町的确就像是御机这件华服上的一块旧补丁。这不是你一个人能改变的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_136_hsguma_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "尽我所能而已。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铁斋",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1895_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "也罢，尽是聊这些扫兴的事，我都给忘了......般若呢？刚刚金兵卫在的时候我瞥了一眼，好像和当年交到你手里时有哪里不一样了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_136_hsguma_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这个......实不相瞒，被人切断了一个角。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铁斋",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1895_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "切断了一个角？用什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_136_hsguma_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "剑。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "老人刚刚还仿佛看破世情的眼睛里忽然发出热切的光。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铁斋",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1895_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "谁的剑？什么材质？剑招如何？还是用了什么法术？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_136_hsguma_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我在龙门的好朋友，好同事——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铁斋",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1895_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "用嘴说太慢了。把般若给我，我看看。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铁斋",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1895_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这——啧啧......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铁斋",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1895_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这不是只靠材料先进，或者什么单纯的法术就能砍出来的断面。天外有天不假，但般若也不是什么凡俗物件——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铁斋",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1895_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铁斋",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1895_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......赤霄。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_136_hsguma_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "铁斋叔，您只看断面就？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铁斋",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1895_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "别忘了，我也是吃过见过的。跟炎国的贸易代表喝得酒酣耳热的时候，我也听说过赤霄的传闻。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铁斋",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1895_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在赤霄剑下吃亏，对般若而言，不冤。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铁斋",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1895_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但归根结底，赤霄也好，般若也罢，都不是只靠本身的锐利或坚固就成其为神兵利器的东西。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铁斋",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1895_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你在心性上输了那个用赤霄剑的，不多，一点点，但这一点点，足够分出胜负。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铁斋",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1895_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这么看来，金兵卫这封信也不算完全没用，至少给了般若一次机会。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_136_hsguma_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您要重铸它？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铁斋",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1895_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不然呢，我就让你带着这面缺了角的盾在龙门到处跑？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铁斋",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1895_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不过......我还得再想想这面盾到底怎么重铸，才有胜过赤霄的一线机会......让我再想想，再想想......"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "那个山崩于前而面不改色的老头一下子变了，变成了一个得知人外有人后心痒难耐，非要一较高下不可的年轻人。\n尽管旧识刚刚的那一刀将离愁别绪击得粉碎，星熊还是在此刻感受到一丝久违的怀念。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铁斋",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1895_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗐，算了，这不是你和我坐在这儿想就能想明白的东西。再给我点时间。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铁斋",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1895_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你被警察审了整整一夜，肯定也困了。去客房睡会儿吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_136_hsguma_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......不了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铁斋",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1895_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_136_hsguma_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我只是想......先去祭奠家父。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铁斋",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1895_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_136_hsguma_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "抱歉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铁斋",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1895_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他是你亲爹，你跟我道什么歉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_136_hsguma_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那栋诊疗所，我原来的家，现在还在吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铁斋",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1895_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在，只是从差不多十年前就没人在住，现在应该已经荒得不成样子了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "锻冶町北街巷尾，废弃多年的古宅，是人人口中的“鬼宅”。\n恶鬼消失后，舍弟头岛须一家入住此宅，可不过三月，家主染病急逝。\n半年后，当时是若头补佐的佐野口买下此宅，请大师做法七日七夜后，携新婚妻子搬入宅邸。\n七日后的深夜，巡警听见“鬼宅”中传出凄惨的哀嚎。佐野口夜中发狂，持家传的宝刀砍死了妻子，随后自尽而死。\n往后数年，但凡敢住进“鬼宅”的人，没有一人得以善终，最终，“鬼宅”再无人敢碰。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1918_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "传闻说，恶鬼并没有消失。她的冤魂时不时会在“鬼宅”出现。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1918_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那么今天......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_oldwarehouse_n"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_4202_haruka_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这里黑漆漆一片，根本看不清有什么......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_4202_haruka_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（点亮手电）澪、澪小姐，你在吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_4202_haruka_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哇——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_4202_haruka_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "原、原来是易拉罐啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "耳机里的声音",
      "speakerId": "avg_4202_haruka_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "萌萌香，稳一点，你头上的摄像机晃得太厉害了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_4202_haruka_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "澪小姐去哪了？她说好要来陪我的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "耳机里的声音",
      "speakerId": "avg_4202_haruka_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她得了感冒，身体不舒服，临时请假了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_4202_haruka_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我认识澪小姐这么多年，从没见她生过病，更别说去年冬天她在我面前吃了二十个雪糕都没事......这种人怎么可能得感冒嘛......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "耳机里的声音",
      "speakerId": "avg_4202_haruka_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "萌萌香，我们这都是为了节目效果，你配合一下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_4202_haruka_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但我刚刚在演唱会上遇到了那个恶鬼啊，现在又探访她的鬼宅......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "耳机里的声音",
      "speakerId": "avg_4202_haruka_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哎，你放心好啦。没事的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_4202_haruka_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我往里面再走走。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_4202_haruka_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉，这里怎么这么多易拉罐......嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_4202_haruka_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不对......怎、怎么声音是从身后传过来的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_136_hsguma_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "谁在那里？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_4202_haruka_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "恶鬼？幽灵？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_136_hsguma_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是你？你来我家干什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "萌萌香随手从地上摸起半截像棍子似的东西对准那团黑影。\n但她很快意识到这玩意儿对幽灵和恶鬼之类的东西似乎不起作用，慌忙之中把棍子揣进怀里，掏出了一盒......\n炒豆子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_4202_haruka_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "恶鬼，这、这、这是炒豆子，你敢过来，我就丢你了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_4202_haruka_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "鬼出去！福进来！鬼出去，福、福进......来......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_4202_haruka_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "豆子没用，我这儿还有盐！你看这是什么！这是盐！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_4202_haruka_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你最......怕......的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_136_hsguma_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_4202_haruka_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "对不起再见我们从来没有见过我这就走给您添麻烦了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_136_hsguma_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喂，你停下！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_4202_haruka_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我哪敢停啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_4202_haruka_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我的头！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_136_hsguma_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你没事吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "头不知撞在什么东西上的萌萌香原本就要倒地，听见“幽灵”的呼喊，一个激灵，忽地又站了起来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_4202_haruka_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我没事——我没事——对不起，打扰了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_4202_haruka_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我家里上有......下有......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_4202_haruka_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不对，根本就什么都没有——不不不，我还有叶助要等我回去浇水，请你一定放我回去啊求你了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "情急之下，萌萌香甚至发出了自己在录音室也从未达到的高音。\n照节目组当天晚些时候的意见，很难说星熊更像幽灵，还是萌萌香更像发出凄婉哀嚎的冤魂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_4202_haruka_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我、我脚下是什么？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_136_hsguma_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你问我？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_4202_haruka_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不是！我没问你，你放我一个人——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "眼前咋咋呼呼的女孩子突然消失了，还带起了满屋的扬尘。\n百思不得其解的星熊凑到旁边仔细看了看，终于看出了其中的门道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_136_hsguma_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "楼板被她蹦塌了一块。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
